      "text": "The company rehired, newly hired, or promoted 350 experienced engineers to fill the gap. Ford brought back technical specialists who hunt for failure points before a part ever reaches the plant floor.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/hlrqc5bCkb",
      "url": "https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2072115719542817143",
